    <div id="w-node-fffcdbaa-d7a7-3f60-bb70-88c1a94e1b9a-f89852d3">
      <h1 class="h2"><strong class="bold-text-2">Who</strong> we Are</h1>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <p>
          The NIGSIMS platform seeks to create a new agricultural marketplace
          that will create both wealth and jobs for participants by furthering
          the liberalization of the Nigerian agricultural seed input supply
          chain ecosystem.
        </p>
        <p>
          NIGSIMS achieves this by enabling a new class of entrepreneurs to
          become seed traders engaged in the buying and selling of high-quality
          seed input to farmers in the target market states.
        </p>
        <p>
          In order to enable best quality crop production that will meet the
          rising demands and needs of citizens, NIGSIMS brings together
          different players such as Farmers, Seed traders, Seed companies and
          National Agricultural Seed Council (NASC) regulations and traders with
          an overall goal of ensuring the distribution of quality seeds to
          farmers. .
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      id="w-node-_27884092-f777-2dab-20b2-0315bcf50154-f89852d3"
      class="div-block-13"
    >
      <h1 class="h2"><strong class="bold-text-3">What</strong> We Do</h1>
      <div style="text-align: center;">
        <p>
          NIGSIMS is committed to automating and facilitating an efficient
          distribution network of quality and certified seeds to farmers.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div
      id="w-node-c271ba2b-e497-9efc-73ef-23000f57b89a-f89852d3"
      class="about what-we-do"
    ></div>
