  <div class="div-block-12">
    <div>
      <h1 class="h2">Our <strong class="bold-text-4">Objectives</strong></h1>
    </div>
    <ul role="list" class="list">
      <li class="list-item">To Increase access to quality seed and seed
        information
      </li>
      <li class="list-item">Liberalization of the seed ecosystem through
        automation of NASC processes</li>
      <li class="list-item">To assist the farmers to access certified/quality
        seeds of suitable varieties at reasonable prices.</li>
      <li class="list-item">To identify potential partners and innovative
        entrepreneurs.</li>

    </ul>
  </div>

